*.wav
*.raw
# GRC auto-generates a same-named .py companion next to every .grc file when
# you open/run it in the actual GNU Radio Companion GUI (not grcc's -o dir,
# which is fine -- this is specifically the in-place one GRC itself drops
# here). Same "only the generator is tracked" convention as the wav/raw
# rules above. Doesn't affect make_fdv_test_iq.py -- .gitignore never
# untracks a file that's already tracked, only hides untracked ones.
*.py
